@swarmy/templates

Some templates in this package are adapted from the Coolify service templates
(https://github.com/coollabsio/coolify, templates/compose), which are
Copyright (c) Coolify contributors and licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Templates adapted from Coolify carry `source: { kind: 'coolify', path }`,
which the gallery shows as an attribution line. They were modified for swarmy:
they are rewritten as swarmy.yaml, bundled databases are replaced with
swarmy-managed services, and Coolify's magic variables are replaced with
swarmy-generated secrets.
